koz Semantics : functions and calls finkoz

zafer addition(a, b)
ouver
    ran a èk b
fèrm

keksoz x idon 4
keksoz y idon 2

koz error : function declaration already exists finkoz
zafer addition(a, b)
ouver
    ran a mwin b
fèrm

koz error : a function cannot take the name of a variable finkoz
zafer x()
ouver
    ran 1
fèrm

koz error : duplicate parameter finkoz
zafer karé(n, n)
ouver
    ran n fwa n
fèrm

koz error : a function cannot be called before it is declared finkoz
afise(triple(x))
zafer triple(n)
ouver
    ran n fwa 3
fèrm

koz error : the function does not exist finkoz
afise(soustraksyon(x, y))

koz error : incorrect argument count finkoz
afise(addition(x))
afise(addition(x, y, 1))
afise()

koz error : the expression is not callable finkoz
keksoz rézilta idon x(1)
keksoz otr idon 5(3)
afise(addition(x, y)(1))

koz error : function used as a value finkoz
keksoz kopi idon addition
afise(addition èk 1)

koz error : cannot assign to a function or to a built-in finkoz
addition idon 5
afise idon 5

koz error : a nested function is only visible inside its parent finkoz
zafer parent(n)
ouver
    zafer zanfan(m)
    ouver
        ran m èk n
    fèrm
    ran zanfan(n)
fèrm
afise(zanfan(1))

koz error : return outside of a function finkoz
ran x
ouver
    ran y
fèrm
